{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Tiny Connections",
    "steam_appid": 2736650,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736650/extras/59584edbc51ef7bb3343d16c6c1a15a9.avif?t=1728657907\" width=644 height=290 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple Concept, Deep Strategy</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tiny Connections unveils a gridded landscape filled with randomly appearing houses and resource buildings. Each house, distinguished by its color, requires a connection to a resource building of the same color. Your task is to draw connections \u2013 using pipes, power lines, or other conduits \u2013 to link these structures. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The real challenge lies in resource management. With limited connection parts, strategic thinking is key. Utilize special abilities like underground tunnels to extend your reach while conserving resources. Avoid crossing lines and manage the limited connection points on resource buildings to succeed. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 Innovative Resource Management: Master the art of resource allocation with limited supplies in each level. Strategic use is key to progress! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf08 Color-Coding Puzzles: Dive into a world of color! Connect houses to similarly colored resource buildings for a visually appealing and strategically deep experience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd04 Dynamic Puzzle Environments: No two puzzles are the same with our ever-changing, randomly generated grids. Stay sharp and ready for anything! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f1 Time-Based Challenges: Race against the clock in daily and weekly challenges. These exciting scenarios are perfect for testing your speed and skill. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 Global Leaderboards and Achievements: Show off your talents and climb the ranks! Compete with players around the world and unlock achievements to showcase your strategic mastery. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to immerse yourself in this challenging puzzle adventure and put your strategic skills to the test? <strong>Connect, strategize, and conquer!</strong> </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736650/extras/59584edbc51ef7bb3343d16c6c1a15a9.avif?t=1728657907\" width=644 height=290 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple Concept, Deep Strategy</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tiny Connections unveils a gridded landscape filled with randomly appearing houses and resource buildings. Each house, distinguished by its color, requires a connection to a resource building of the same color. Your task is to draw connections \u2013 using pipes, power lines, or other conduits \u2013 to link these structures. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The real challenge lies in resource management. With limited connection parts, strategic thinking is key. Utilize special abilities like underground tunnels to extend your reach while conserving resources. Avoid crossing lines and manage the limited connection points on resource buildings to succeed. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 Innovative Resource Management: Master the art of resource allocation with limited supplies in each level. Strategic use is key to progress! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf08 Color-Coding Puzzles: Dive into a world of color! Connect houses to similarly colored resource buildings for a visually appealing and strategically deep experience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd04 Dynamic Puzzle Environments: No two puzzles are the same with our ever-changing, randomly generated grids. Stay sharp and ready for anything! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f1 Time-Based Challenges: Race against the clock in daily and weekly challenges. These exciting scenarios are perfect for testing your speed and skill. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 Global Leaderboards and Achievements: Show off your talents and climb the ranks! Compete with players around the world and unlock achievements to showcase your strategic mastery. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to immerse yourself in this challenging puzzle adventure and put your strategic skills to the test? <strong>Connect, strategize, and conquer!</strong> </p>",
    "short_description": "Embark on a journey, where each puzzle takes you to a new corner of the globe. Your mission is to connect homes to essential services like electricity &amp; water, battling against time to ensure communities flourish!",
